    // ============================================================================ DRAGON BALL
    // Palm beams are physical, steerable and clash (bd_sim signature/palm.rs); what separates the
    // family is the ELEMENT (what the beam does to you) and the CALIBER (scale): Kamehameha = light
    // push; Galick Gun = psychic (a hit floats you — juggle window); Final Flash = electric and huge
    // (stuns, bores hills); Masenko = small and quick; Special Beam Cannon is not a palm beam at all
    // but an instant drilling line (Carve); Death Beam an instant finger laser that doesn't carve.
